Subject: Allow explicit sandbox supervisor capability additions
Base-Commit: 97031ea81fee1b853e4cd89e5490b1be9f5ead55
Upstream: https://github.com/opensandbox-group/OpenSandbox
License: Apache-2.0

Experimental: adding capabilities affects the whole sandbox. This patch is
not sufficient to qualify the workload or enable generated-code execution.
Defaults remain unchanged. Applied only in an isolated trusted probe.

